# Acting in Good Faith (windurst 64): 680's reply kind at Eperdur, whose script answers here: at San d'Oria fame level 4
# and main level 10 his script calls Healing the Land (C#), which offers 681. Accepted by GM with the letter, a full
# bag: 680 (the scroll does not fit: complete fails, the letter kept); 680 again right after (a Progress event keeps
# the lookup's turn; an Event would hand this talk to his script's 681); room: 680, completed (the letter taken). Then
# completed: no section, the lookup's default 678 and his script's 681 take turns.
lists NorthernSanDoria/Eperdur/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/680
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=126.5,-6.5,97.5 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Sandoria 225
quest Windurst.ActingInGoodFaith accepted
keyitem GantineuxsLetter
login
fill-inventory
trigger Eperdur                               # the letter: 680
finish                                        # the scroll does not fit: complete fails: the letter kept
trigger Eperdur                               # 680 again (Progress)
finish                                        # still full: nothing
free-inventory
trigger Eperdur                               # 680
finish                                        # completed: fame 40, the Scroll of Teleport-Mea, Pilgrim to Mea; the letter taken
trigger Eperdur                               # completed: no section; after the Progress 680 the lookup's turn: his default 678
finish
trigger Eperdur                               # his script's turn: Healing the Land's 681
finish
